From: Takashi Iwai <tiwai-l3A5Bk7waGM@public.gmane.org>
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] ALSA: usb-audio: Fix races at disconnection in mixer_quirks.c
Date: Mon, 15 Oct 2012 13:03:42 +0200
Message-ID: <s5h4nlwt2sx.wl%tiwai@suse.de>
References: <s5ha9vot2yi.wl%tiwai@suse.de>
